{"parentUuid":"1bb4bdea-261b-4ceb-9401-b498d5a2cf99","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeEuDdVmuoSmmYvqCFeY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The refactor is done; reload http://127.0.0.1:8765/v3/. Nothing on the page looks different. A before/after screenshot comparison at five widths, plus the blur gate, the playground after drawing and the video mode, came out identical apart from the blur pixels described below. The functional and layout tests all pass with the same numbers as before, with no errors and no sideways scroll.\n\n**What changed:**\n- **One blur:** the page had three separate pixel-blur implementations: the fake key in the Blur cell, the blur gate, and the playground's blur tool. They used slightly different formulas, and two of them let the browser choose which pixel represents each block. Now one shared function does it for all three, coloring each square from the pixel at its center, as Skryn's blur does. The fake key looks exactly as before; the gate and the playground's blur have a slightly different but equivalent scatter of gray squares.\n- **Lighter unblur animation:** the gate now renders its source image once instead of on every frame of the animation, and frees it when the animation ends.\n- **One entry point:** the four scripts are now named functions (`initNav`, `initMarks`, `initDemo`, `initPlayground`), started from one place. The laptop-vs-phone check and the screenshot size are each defined once instead of twice.\n- **Dead code removed:**\n  - the playground's phone-only code paths, which can't run now that phones get the video;\n  - CSS rules duplicated when light mode was removed, and styles for the deleted shortcut table;\n  - an orphaned `.menu` rule, a stale class, two unused ids and an empty comment.\n- **Tidying:** the demo's styles are grouped in order (frame, play button, modes, playground, gate), an inline style moved into the stylesheet, and the header markup and playground code are indented consistently.\n\nThe file is about 2 KB larger, only because the playground code gained 4 spaces of indentation inside its new function. I saved a backup of the pre-refactor version in case anything looks off in real Safari.\n\nStill pending is making v3 the live page: moving it to `docs/index.html`, deleting v1, v2 and the assets only they use, and committing. Say when you want it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3623,"cache_read_input_tokens":516061,"output_tokens":969,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":257},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3623,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":969,"cache_read_input_tokens":516061,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3623,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3623},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"54569aec-87a8-4e81-8542-b1a1af001ac6","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfeEuCGPbWkopPY7cUPVn","type":"assistant","uuid":"0458190f-819f-40fa-bf69-b538f7390b33","timestamp":"2026-10-02T22:59:53.000Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","sessionId":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"main"}
