 onto the menu bar icon to annotate it like a screenshot.</span></li>\",\n    \"<li><b>Drop an image on the icon</b><span>Any image file opens for markup, like a screenshot.</span></li>\")\n# install / updating\nrep(\"<small>On macOS 14, right-click the app → Open also works.</small>\", \"<small>On macOS 14, right-click → Open works too.</small>\")\nrep(\"<p>Since v0.1.6, Skryn is signed with a stable certificate, so Screen Recording permission carries over when you update.</p>\",\n    \"<p>Since v0.1.6, Screen Recording permission carries over when you update.</p>\")\nrep(\"<p>Coming from v0.1.5 or earlier? The signature changed, so reset it once if screenshots stop working:</p>\",\n    \"<p>Updating from v0.1.5 or earlier? If screenshots stop working, reset it once:</p>\")\nrep(\"<li>Take a screenshot. Skryn asks for permission again.</li>\", \"<li>Take a screenshot; Skryn asks for permission again</li>\")\nopen(p, \"w\").write(s)\nprint(\"ok\")\nEOF","description":"Apply copy edits to the live page"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01Do7JQzcJWDQ7M6cBfPd7sH":{"cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"9ae19739-2fcb-47f2-ba82-2298014b7663","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CfeGJMBB8zDjNuH8FEfB4","type":"assistant","uuid":"9a7d780b-4d22-4c63-b0a2-47258d73a4ac","timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:18:25.601Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","sessionId":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"main"}
