{"parentUuid":"2aa5ee5c-63be-40b9-944c-2b1cfd7b0eea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeGSBnbT8WXDgzWmAbRt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013Rek6KxvJmMcK4LmUZnwqs","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/rsedykh/.claude/projects/-Users-rsedykh-GitHub-skryn/memory/site-redesign-and-video-remake.md","content":"---\nname: site-redesign-and-video-remake\ndescription: skryn.app redesign shipped 2026-10-02 (\"Marked up\" design, live playground); promo video still to be remade to match\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nOn 2026-10-02 the redesigned site went live: `docs/index.html` (the \"Marked up\" design: page annotated with Skryn's own marks, dark only, live playground behind a pixel-blur gate on laptops, video on phones) plus `docs/assets/`. The drafts and the old `docs/icon.png` / `docs/promo-poster.jpg` were deleted. A new app icon (window + red circled line + arrow + \"1\" badge on lavender wallpaper) replaced the meme cat in the AppIcon set; source SVG is `docs/assets/icon.svg`.\n\nPending: **remake the promo video \"a little bit\" to match the new style.** At minimum its title and end cards still show the old cat icon. `promo/icon.py` reads `docs/icon.png`, which no longer exists — render the new icon from `docs/assets/icon.svg` instead. The user uploads the final mp4 to GitHub themselves (user-attachments URL), then the site's `<source src>` and README link need the new URL.\n\n**Why:** user said the video can be remade to match once the page is done.\n**How to apply:** offer the video pass when the user returns to the promo; the kit is in `promo/` (see `promo/README.md`, `promo/render.sh`), never committed.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1543,"cache_read_input_tokens":544246,"output_tokens":1183,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1543,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1183,"cache_read_input_tokens":544246,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1543,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1543},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_013Rek6KxvJmMcK4LmUZnwqs":{"file_path":"/Users/rsedykh/.claude/projects/-Users-rsedykh-GitHub-skryn/memory/site-redesign-and-video-remake.md","content":"---\nname: site-redesign-and-video-remake\ndescription: skryn.app redesign shipped 2026-10-02 (\"Marked up\" design, live playground); promo video still to be remade to match\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nOn 2026-10-02 the redesigned site went live: `docs/index.html` (the \"Marked up\" design: page annotated with Skryn's own marks, dark only, live playground behind a pixel-blur gate on laptops, video on phones) plus `docs/assets/`. The drafts and the old `docs/icon.png` / `docs/promo-poster.jpg` were deleted. A new app icon (window + red circled line + arrow + \"1\" badge on lavender wallpaper) replaced the meme cat in the AppIcon set; source SVG is `docs/assets/icon.svg`.\n\nPending: **remake the promo video \"a little bit\" to match the new style.** At minimum its title and end cards still show the old cat icon. `promo/icon.py` reads `docs/icon.png`, which no longer exists — render the new icon from `docs/assets/icon.svg` instead. The user uploads the final mp4 to GitHub themselves (user-attachments URL), then the site's `<source src>` and README link need the new URL.\n\n**Why:** user said the video can be remade to match once the page is done.\n**How to apply:** offer the video pass when the user returns to the promo; the kit is in `promo/` (see `promo/README.md`, `promo/render.sh`), never committed.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"deaf429f-ce83-4b60-9e8e-a1a80de8d4ab","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfeGSBF7VLjaDaFQwZ5Un","type":"assistant","uuid":"258598e8-6e4f-4097-b66f-037ec410ddc6","timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:19:59.717Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","sessionId":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"main"}
