{"parentUuid":"13ea9f21-5b43-40e5-b22c-ada97a1b3e5b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeGZfxSuEwe96hNwohHL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The new site is live at https://skryn.app, and the page and all eight files in `assets/` load from it. Before pushing I did the copy review and re-ran the layout and demo tests from the site root; everything passed.\n\n**Copy changes**, mostly cutting repetition and wordiness:\n- **Hero:** the paragraph no longer repeats ⇧⌘5, since the headline's hotkey tag already shows it.\n- **Tools:** the intro is down to \"Each tool is marked up with itself. The key you hold as you start dragging picks the tool.\" Some descriptions are tighter:\n  - \"strike a path\" became \"cross something out\";\n  - the Crop note now says \"Only what's inside makes it into the image\";\n  - badges now say \"Two quick digits make one number\", which is more accurate than \"in a row\" since the digits must come within half a second.\n- **Editing list:** short labels (Move a mark, Resize it, Delete it, Undo/redo, Edit text). I dropped the red/blue row, because the Color tool already covers it.\n- **Output:** \"Pick the modifiers in Settings. ⌘W closes without saving.\" The upload card now reads \"Uploads to Uploadcare with your public key and copies the link. If the upload fails, the PNG is saved locally.\"\n- **Menu bar:** the \"Drop an image\" line no longer repeats what the picture already says.\n- **Updating:** the certificate explanation is gone: \"Since v0.1.6, Screen Recording permission carries over when you update.\" I confirmed v0.1.6 is released, and that `U` really stamps the capture time.\n\n**Pushed to `main`:**\n- **`Replace the app icon`:** the new icon in the app's icon set. It ships with the next release; I kept it a separate commit so you can revert it on its own.\n- **`Redesign the website`:** the new page and its assets. It also deletes the old `icon.png` and `promo-poster.jpg`, and adds a Website section to `CLAUDE.md`. That section says how the site is built and that the playground copies the app's drawing rules, so the two need to change together.\n\nThe drafts and the files only they used are in the Trash, not committed. If a browser still shows the old page, that's GitHub's cache, which clears within about 10 minutes.\n\nStill to do is the promo video remake. Its title and end cards show the old cat icon, and the script that cut out the icon for those cards read the old `docs/icon.png`, which is gone now. I've saved that in memory for when we pick the video up."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":494,"cache_read_input_tokens":550379,"output_tokens":927,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":113},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":494,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":927,"cache_read_input_tokens":550379,"cache_creation_input_tokens":494,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":494},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f6fbe1db-48f5-4442-856e-7218731e95ee","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfeGZfB588sya4bvk5YQ4","type":"assistant","uuid":"dd2e90e7-5a2d-490c-a3bb-509540435d03","timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:21:40.569Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","sessionId":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"main"}
