{"parentUuid":"17a63a81-0b25-49cb-8254-43d0d59e2c42","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeHtJGNKENatPpPormjW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I tried two versions:\n- **A, a lighter dark shade:** this keeps the problem. Red on mid-gray stays weak, and the white caption almost disappears.\n- **B, no dark shade at all:** the blurred screenshot is lightened toward white instead, which is how Skryn's red marks look on a real white screenshot in the app.\n\nB was clearly better, so the page now uses it:\n- **Note and arrow:** \"No install needed\" and the arrow stand out in red on the light background.\n- **Button:** Try it is now a dark pill, since a light one would vanish on white.\n- **Link and caption:** \"or watch the video\" and the caption are dark text.\n\nI checked it at 600, 760, 1000 and 1440px, and the demo still works. Reload http://127.0.0.1:8765/ to see it. It's still local; tell me when to push."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2897,"cache_read_input_tokens":600204,"output_tokens":277,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2897,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":277,"cache_read_input_tokens":600204,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2897,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2897},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"95e6b4ea-e459-41a2-939b-8e21f78f508a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfeHtHev3GFWfDU2oUmEK","type":"assistant","uuid":"dda264ac-d728-48ea-9559-212bf689dcca","timestamp":"2026-10-02T2