{"parentUuid":"f3f4aa4c-cf1c-431e-9064-d79630493590","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeJFZTWvsSRkKvrF5efp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The new video (v2) is ready to watch at `promo/skryn-promo-v2.mp4`, with sound; there's also an overview of every scene in `promo/skryn-promo-v2-contact-sheet.png`.\n\n- **Look:**\n  - The title card is the new icon with \"Screenshot it. Mark it up. Send it.\" on the site's dark background.\n  - The chapters keep their colors, but as deep, muted tones (navy, brown, green, indigo, olive) instead of pastels. Captions and keycaps match the site.\n  - The end card has the new icon, \"Screenshot and annotate, from the menu bar.\" and skryn.app.\n- **Music:** new, fully synthesized soft lo-fi electronic instead of the bossa. A pad plays under the title card, and the beat starts on the first chapter cut. It builds through the chapters and lands on a held chord at the end card.\n  - The agent couldn't actually hear it. The mix was judged from levels and a click scan, so it needs a real listen.\n  - It's at the same quiet background level as v1. If it's too quiet or too loud, that's a quick change.\n- **One content change:** the app now enlarges text in bigger steps (24 → 32 → 40pt). The old \"Copy the test key\" note would have wrapped onto two lines, so it now reads \"Copy test key\" at 32pt. The video is 41 seconds, 0.4 s shorter.\n\nYour v1 files are untouched. A poster image for the site is ready (`promo/v2-for-docs/assets/poster.webp`), taken from a frame without the old icon.\n\nTo put v2 on the site, the video has to be uploaded to GitHub first, and that's yours to do: drag `promo/skryn-promo-v2-web.mp4` (4.2 MB) into any GitHub comment box or a README edit, and copy the `user-attachments` link it produces without saving. Send me the link and I'll swap it into the site and the README, along with the new poster.\n\nThe demo-gate tweaks (the light Try it button, the arrow, the no-shift fix) are still local too, and can go out in the same push."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4785,"cache_read_input_tokens":620609,"output_tokens":867,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":176},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4785,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":867,"cache_read_input_tokens":620609,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4785,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4785},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ec2b6f8b-3902-450c-b627-2cd275107b97","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfeJFYYwtw1RwomQW9Rvy","type":"assistant","uuid":"d35de422-4324-4fd5-a0f3-20589447c344","timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:43:50.011Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","sessionId":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"main"}
