{"parentUuid":"dcc71908-9fc2-4623-b9fd-13520a607898","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeK9BgmvQEN2P1g3JyvZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The blur pattern now shifts until the caption (\"A browser replica of the annotation window, with the app's keys.\") sits on solid page color.\n\n- **How it picks the offset:** it tests shifts of up to 6 blocks in each direction. It takes the one that leaves the caption clear, prefers one that also clears the red note and the video link, and otherwise uses the smallest shift. It recalculates when the window is resized.\n- **Widths checked:** the caption is fully clear at 1440, 1000, 760 and 600px. At 600px, one small block still touches \"or watch the video\".\n- **Opening:** when you click Try it, the shift slides back to zero while the blocks shrink and the colors flip, so the real screenshot lands exactly in place. The demo test still passes.\n\nReload http://127.0.0.1:8765/ to see it. All the gate work is still local, ready to push whenever you say. The v3 video is still being made in the background."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1195,"cache_read_input_tokens":664469,"output_tokens":364,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":60},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1195,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":364,"cache_read_input_tokens":664469,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1195,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1195},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b5f04257-d4f5-4660-ae64-a4912bf78fe6","apiBlockI