{"parentUuid":"7bd0d56b-31db-4604-8eaf-fa6491488f2d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeKGjE317s2FvrgwtfVN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Version 3 of the video is ready at `promo/skryn-promo-v3.mp4`; there's an overview of every scene in `promo/skryn-promo-v3-contact-sheet.png`.\n\n- **Colors:** the brown and gold are gone. The tools chapter is now deep plum and the crop/output chapter deep teal. Navy, green and indigo stayed, so all five chapters are distinct, and the title and end cards are still on the site's dark background.\n- **Music:** new, fully synthesized, chill minimal techno at about 122 bpm. The title card has a filtered pad with an echoing chord. On the first chapter cut a soft four-on-the-floor kick drops in with offbeat hi-hats and a rolling bassline. Layers build up chapter by chapter, and it lands on a held chord at the end card. The level is the same quiet background level as before, and the beat sits within a frame of the cuts.\n- **Needs your ears:** the agent couldn't listen to it; the mix was judged from measurements only. The kick's lowest bass won't come through laptop speakers, so try headphones too.\n\nv1 and v2 are untouched for comparison. A matching poster for the site is ready too (`promo/v3-for-docs/assets/poster.webp`).\n\nIf you like it, upload `promo/skryn-promo-v3-web.mp4` (4.3 MB) by dragging it into any GitHub comment box, then copy the link it generates. Send me that link and I'll switch the site and README to it, swap in the poster, and push together with the demo-gate changes. Those are still local too; I can push them on their own first if you'd rather not wait."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4787,"cache_read_input_tokens":667669,"output_tokens":538,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"