{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-03T00:02:18.441Z","sessionId":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>adfde5ca4fa51246c</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>REDACTED</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>REDACTED.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Remake promo video v2\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>The v3 docked caption now sits 24 px higher, and v3 is re-rendered in place with that change.\n\n**What moved:** the docked caption's center went from y 84 to y 60 at 1080p (`dockY` in `render/Stage.swift`, v3 only; v1 and v2 keep 84). The fade itself is unchanged and still starts at y 118. In every docked still (capture, tools, marks, edit, crop and paste) the descenders used to end 6 px above the fade and now end 29 px above it. The text tops sit at y 40–43, so there's still room above. I checked frames mid-dock in the tools and output chapters: the big centered caption slides up smoothly to the new spot and clears the fade throughout.\n\n**Re-rendered and overwritten:**\n- `skryn-promo-v3.mp4` and `skryn-promo-v3-web.mp4`, each with 2463 frames, ending together with the audio at about 41.05 s.\n- `skryn-promo-v3-silent.mp4` and `skryn-promo-v3.meta.json`. The chapter timing is identical to before, so I reused the existing v3 music and remuxed it; it measures −32.1 LUFS as before.\n- `stills/v3/`, `poster-v3.jpg` and `v3-for-docs/assets/poster.webp`.\n- The promo README notes the change.\n\nNothing outside `promo/` was touched, and colors, music and timing are unchanged.\n\nContact sheet: `/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn/promo/skryn-promo-v3-contact-sheet.png`</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>661264</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>7</tool_uses><duration_ms>207250</duration_ms></usage>\