{"parentUuid":"d81ba314-0e4e-4f3f-817a-3e616ac9abc5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeKt9aDZJtAXPLF3GaBk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything is ready locally:\n- **Video link:** the new link replaces the old one in both places on the site and in the README.\n- **Poster:** it's the v3 frame (the crop, in the teal chapter), with no cat icon anywhere.\n- **Other pending changes:** the demo-gate changes and the \"Installation.\" heading.\n\nThe only thing missing is making the video public. The old video's link works anonymously because it was saved somewhere public; the new one is visible only to you. The surest fix is to post the upload in this public repo:\n\n1. Open an issue in `rsedykh/skryn` (for example \"Promo video v3\"), drag `promo/skryn-promo-v3-web.mp4` into the comment box, and **submit** it. You can close the issue afterwards.\n2. Send me the link from the submitted comment. It may be the same one or a new one.\n\nBefore pushing, I'll check that it loads anonymously. Your local preview server also stopped (it hit the 2-hour limit); tell me if you want it back to look before release."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2034,"cache_read_input_tokens":682304,"output_tokens":572,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":242},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2034,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":572,"cache_read_input_tokens":682304,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2034,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2034},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClas