{"parentUuid":"bf4bbf96-dcb5-41d1-9c56-2fcd659abfbe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeLHhM4nHDdvD3AVFA6s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Released. Updating my notes, since the video remake is no longer pending:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":370,"cache_read_input_tokens":535221,"output_tokens":689,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":56},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":370,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":689,"cache_read_input_tokens":535221,"cache_creation_input_tokens":370,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":370},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"befe4d92-5471-44eb-8977-bae1834cc17c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfeLHgirTpKBCPTihM9mL","type":"assistant","uuid":"6315c60a-4031-44b8-842d-7f00c2136bbe","timestamp":"2026-10-03T00:10:24.302Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","sessionId":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"6315c60a-4031-44b8-842d-7f00c2136bbe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeLHhM4nHDdvD3AVFA6s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QhAA6JhCfZbMUtNfFvBTfp","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/rsedykh/.claude/projects/-Users-rsedykh-GitHub-skryn/memory/site-redesign-and-video-remake.md","content":"---\nname: site-redesign-and-video-remake\ndescription: skryn.app redesign + promo video v3 shipped 2026-10-02; how the video is hosted and how to swap it\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nShipped 2026-10-02: the redesigned site (`docs/index.html`, \"Marked up\" design, dark only, live playground behind an inverted-blur gate on laptops, video on phones) and promo video **v3** (new icon, dark site colors with plum/teal instead of brown/gold, synthesized chill-techno music). The kit in `promo/` (git-excluded) renders takes with `TAKE=v1|v2|v3`; v3 is the current one.\n\nThe demo video is a GitHub user-attachment: `https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e71aa5b3-80e6-4399-9993-0efe7728c68f`, referenced in `docs/index.html` (twice) and `README.md`. The site's poster is `docs/assets/poster.webp` (from `promo/v3-for-docs/assets/poster.webp`).\n\n**Why:** a fresh upload's URL only works for the uploader until the content is saved somewhere public — it 404'd anonymously until the user committed the README change on github.com.\n**How to apply:** when swapping the video again, have the user commit the new link in the README (or post it in a public issue) first, verify with an anonymous `curl -r 0-99` (expect 206 video/mp4), then update `docs/index.html` and push.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":370,"cache_read_input_tokens":535221,"output_tokens":689,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":56},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":370,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":689,"cache_read_input_tokens":535221,"cache_creation_input_tokens":370,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":370},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01QhAA6JhCfZbMUtNfFvBTfp":{"file_path":"/Users/rsedykh/.claude/projects/-Users-rsedykh-GitHub-skryn/memory/site-redesign-and-video-remake.md","content":"---\nname: site-redesign-and-video-remake\ndescription: skryn.app redesign + promo video v3 shipped 2026-10-02; how the video is hosted and how to swap it\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nShipped 2026-10-02: the redesigned site (`docs/index.html`, \"Marked up\" design, dark only, live playground behind an inverted-blur gate on laptops, video on phones) and promo video **v3** (new icon, dark site colors with plum/teal instead of brown/gold, synthesized chill-techno music). The kit in `promo/` (git-excluded) renders takes with `TAKE=v1|v2|v3`; v3 is the current one.\n\nThe demo video is a GitHub user-attachment: `https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e71aa5b3-80e6-4399-9993-0efe7728c68f`, referenced in `docs/index.html` (twice) and `README.md`. The site's poster is `docs/assets/poster.webp` (from `promo/v3-for-docs/assets/poster.webp`).\n\n**Why:** a fresh upload's URL only works for the uploader until the content is saved somewhere public — it 404'd anonymously until the user committed the README change on github.com.\n**How to apply:** when swapping the video again, have the user commit the new link in the README (or post it in a public issue) first, verify with an anonymous `curl -r 0-99` (expect 206 video/mp4), then update `docs/index.html` and push.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"befe4d92-54