{"parentUuid":"3f7f067c-0abf-4433-923f-78dd828986f0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"52177ccf-cd20-43b3-a7ee-9b79984bae02","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QhAA6JhCfZbMUtNfFvBTfp","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/rsedykh/.claude/projects/-Users-rsedykh-GitHub-skryn/memory/site-redesign-and-video-remake.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"224e7a29-bef0-4e02-ac23-7e7bedb1732f","timestamp":"2026-10-03T00:10:29.088Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"update","filePath":"/Users/rsedykh/.claude/projects/-Users-rsedykh-GitHub-skryn/memory/site-redesign-and-video-remake.md","content":"---\nname: site-redesign-and-video-remake\ndescription: skryn.app redesign + promo video v3 shipped 2026-10-02; how the video is hosted and how to swap it\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: 71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038\n  modified: 2026-10-03T00:10:29.085Z\n---\n\nShipped 2026-10-02: the redesigned site (`docs/index.html`, \"Marked up\" design, dark only, live playground behind an inverted-blur gate on laptops, video on phones) and promo video **v3** (new icon, dark site colors with plum/teal instead of brown/gold, synthesized chill-techno music). The kit in `promo/` (git-excluded) renders takes with `TAKE=v1|v2|v3`; v3 is the current one.\n\nThe demo video is a GitHub user-attachment: `https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e71aa5b3-80e6-4399-9993-0efe7728c68f`, referenced in `docs/index.html` (twice) and `README.md`. The site's poster is `docs/assets/poster.webp` (from `promo/v3-for-docs/assets/poster.webp`).\n\n**Why:** a fresh upload's URL only works for the uploader until the content is saved somewhere public — it 404'd anonymously until the user committed the README change on github.com.\n**How to apply:** when swapping the video again, have the user commit the new link in the README (or post it in a public issue) first, verify with an anonymous `curl -r 0-99` (expect 206 video/mp4), then update `docs/index.html` and push.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":16,"newStart":1,"newLines":16,"lines":[" ---"," name: site-redesign-and-video-remake","-description: \"skryn.app redesign shipped 2026-10-02 (\\\"Marked up\\\" design, live playground); promo video still to be remade to match\"","+description: skryn.app redesign + promo video v3 shipped 2026-10-02; how the video is hosted and how to swap it"," metadata:","   node_type: memory","   type: project","   originSessionId: 71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","-  modified: 2026-10-02T23:20:00.116Z","+  modified: 2026-10-03T00:10:29.085Z"," ---"," ","-On 2026-10-02 the redesigned site went live: `docs/index.html` (the \"Marked up\" design: page annotated with Skryn's own marks, dark only, live playground behind a pixel-blur gate on laptops, video on phones) plus `docs/assets/`. The drafts and the old `docs/icon.png` / `docs/promo-poster.jpg` were deleted. A new app icon (window + red circled line + arrow + \"1\" badge on lavender wallpaper) replaced the meme cat in the AppIcon set; source SVG is `docs/assets/icon.svg`.","+Shipped 2026-10-02: the redesigned site (`docs/index.html`, \"Marked up\" design, dark only, live playground behind an inverted-blur gate on laptops, video on phones) and promo video **v3** (new icon, dark site colors with plum/teal instead of brown/gold, synthesized chill-techno music). The kit in `promo/` (git-excluded) renders takes with `TAKE=v1|v2|v3`; v3 is the current one."," ","-Pending: **remake the promo video \"a little bit\" to match the new style.** At minimum its title and end cards still show the old cat icon. `promo/icon.py` reads `docs/icon.png`, which no longer exists — render the new icon from `docs/assets/icon.svg` instead. The user uploads the final mp4 to GitHub themselves (user-attachments URL), then the site's `<source src>` and README link need the new URL.","+The demo video is a GitHub user-attachment: `https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e71aa5b3-80e6-4399-9993-0efe7728c68f`, referenced in `docs/index.html` (twice) and `README.md`. The site's poster is `docs/assets/poster.webp` (from `promo/v3-for-docs/assets/poster.webp`)."," ","-**Why:** user said the video can be remade to match once the page is done.","-**How to apply:** offer the video pass when the user returns to the promo; the kit is in `promo/` (see `promo/README.md`, `promo/render.sh`), never committed.","+**Why:** a fresh upload's URL only works for the uploader until the content is saved somewhere public — it 404'd anonymously until the user committed the README change on github.com.","+**How to apply:** when swapping the video again, have the user commit the new link in the README (or post it in a public issue) first, verify with an anonymous `curl -r 0-99` (expect 206 video/mp4), then update `docs/index.html` and push."]}],"originalFile":"---\nname: site-redesign-and-video-remake\ndescription: \"skryn.app redesign shipped 2026-10-02 (\\\"Marked up\\\" design, live playground); promo video still to be remade to match\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: 71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038\n  modified: 2026-10-02T23:20:00.116Z\n---\n\nOn 2026-10-02 the redesigned site went live: `docs/index.html` (the \"Marked up\" design: page annotated with Skryn's own marks, dark only, live playground behind a pixel-blur gate on laptops, video on phones) plus `docs/assets/`. The drafts and the old `docs/icon.png` / `docs/promo-poster.jpg` were deleted. A new app icon (window + red circled line + arrow + \"1\" badge on lavender wallpaper) replaced the meme cat in the AppIcon set; source SVG is `docs/assets/icon.svg`.\n\nPending: **remake the promo video \"a little bit\" to match the new style.** At minimum its title and end cards still show the old cat icon. `promo/icon.py` reads `docs/icon.png`, which no longer exists — render the new icon from `docs/assets/icon.svg` instead. The user uploads the final mp4 to GitHub themselves (user-attachments URL), then the site's `<source src>` and README link need the new URL.\n\n**Why:** user said the video can be remade to match once the page is done.\n**How to apply:** offer the video pass when the user returns to the promo; the kit is in `promo/` (see `promo/README.md`, `promo/render.sh`), never committed.\n","userModified":false,"memdirStamped":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3f7f067c-0abf-4433-923f-78dd828986f0","session_id":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","sessionId":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"main"}
