{"parentUuid":"83221ed6-931a-4e67-941b-a653f497729b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeLJgheNhg6oudehkoUe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It's live at https://skryn.app:\n\n- **Video:** the new v3 plays from your public link (I confirmed signed out: 41 s at 1920×1080).\n- **Poster:** the new poster from the crop chapter is up.\n- **Demo gate:**\n  - the screenshot is inverted on the page color and shifted so the text sits on solid background;\n  - the light Try it button with the red \"No install needed\" arrow and the \"or watch the video\" link;\n  - no background jump when you click Try it.\n- **Heading:** \"Installation.\" now ends with a period.\n\nI pulled your README commit first, so `main` is up to date with no conflicts. My push is one commit on top of it, and the Pages build finished.\n\nThe new app icon was committed earlier and goes out with the next release (v0.1.7). v1 and v2 of the video are still in `promo/`, and the v3 settings stay in the kit, so a future re-render is one command. I noted the video link and the publish-before-use step in memory, in case you swap the video again."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":367,"cache_read_input_tokens":536372,"output_tokens":327,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":367,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":327,"cache_read_input_tokens":536372,"cache_creation_input_tokens":367,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":367},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierReque